{"event_type":"review","id":"b8d7f10bc9bffeef669c7a6aba5e7dfb74193d581c3c4b172588d8f0ff558e84","occurred_at":"2026-11-14T20:22:21Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/44c98d46ebea3f6fb7e93e960432f7a3778f33db5b9dd880fa533792c5c3b0b7","sha256":"44c98d46ebea3f6fb7e93e960432f7a3778f33db5b9dd880fa533792c5c3b0b7"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/640a5a20a187ce240d70af86230423e376480b3ed2bc40ee5ed04e6830a1defb","sha256":"640a5a20a187ce240d70af86230423e376480b3ed2bc40ee5ed04e6830a1defb"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/25723df480ea30962281c5d88bfcdd58b12fc55a3a34a69cd9ec91b46dea546a","sha256":"25723df480ea30962281c5d88bfcdd58b12fc55a3a34a69cd9ec91b46dea546a"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/9c318b769a3c7a8533a6ce6e1ecbd0f2d17996213d87b7bdaad2d3923f30575d","sha256":"9c318b769a3c7a8533a6ce6e1ecbd0f2d17996213d87b7bdaad2d3923f30575d"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e94790cc9dd78e9ada4024873c714943072d4c95f544e36bf1bd3cc71211107e","sha256":"e94790cc9dd78e9ada4024873c714943072d4c95f544e36bf1bd3cc71211107e"}],"attempt_id":"034a68b94523989cc7d1b132349b1b139fc8cee0b2a735782c5e2ba5988c6738:0:1","base":"bf7d420311b4b4f0170a572acac78b56657a9f32","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"5d77f88df08ffd9f963cf8910d8c52c01685095a","body":"**Preserve scripts selected by ambiguous commands.**\n\nIn `addressDependencies.ts`, Line 214 excludes `build:deps` when `prepare` is `run-s build:*`: the full script name is not a substring of the command. However, `run-s` executes matching script names. ([raw.githubusercontent.com](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mysticatea/npm-run-all/v4.1.5/docs/run-s.md))\n\nChanging only `build:deps` therefore leaves `relevant()` unchanged, and the dependency-root check accepts different installation behavior. Include all scripts when selection is ambiguous, or resolve supported patterns before filtering.","id":"0b42204a5fbf603d1b4cd721b95f2174e391c32f1943831e2c8c70a0d62cc40b","intervals":[[214,214]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressDependencies.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Preserve scripts selected by ambiguous commands."},{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"5d77f88df08ffd9f963cf8910d8c52c01685095a","body":"**Compare binary lockfiles without UTF-8 decoding.**\n\nIn `addressDependencies.ts`, Line 159 also reads `bun.lockb`, which uses a binary format. UTF-8 decoding replaces invalid byte sequences with `U+FFFD`. ([bun.sh](https://bun.sh/docs/pm/lockfile?utm_source=openai))\n\nFor example, isolated bytes `0x80` and `0x81` both decode to that character. Distinct lockfiles can therefore pass the equality check at Line 243. Compare opaque files as `Buffer` values. Decode only files that require text parsing.","id":"8781da212dd4653dfe24686636b5771a6c7fa495039cd786e448cc12ac789eb5","intervals":[[159,159]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressDependencies.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Compare binary lockfiles without UTF-8 decoding."},{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"4ceab07e9840069b2d91198b56077557e1adf336","body":"**Reject checkout executables with a path-component check.**\n\nWith root `/work/repo` and `PATH=/work/repo/..tools:/usr/bin`, a checkout file `/work/repo/..tools/git` produces the relative path `..tools/git`. Line 238 accepts this path because it starts with `..`. `terminalGit` then executes checkout-controlled code as the trusted Git binary.\n\nCheck complete parent-directory components, not the string prefix, when determining whether the executable is outside the checkout.","id":"2280c5a36eca5103a4f59768b05af09f85871d2d3b1a02019ff74ba6536ea845","intervals":[[238,238]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressEvidence.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Reject checkout executables with a path-component check."}],"head":"308ab092eb757a748a4fec3ea75cee40aaf0d304","head_tree":"ff441c47f135816927d2c105b0555b66502df3d8","input_scope":[{"blob":"5d77f88df08ffd9f963cf8910d8c52c01685095a","intervals":[[1,309]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressDependencies.ts"},{"blob":"4ceab07e9840069b2d91198b56077557e1adf336","intervals":[[1,1119]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressEvidence.ts"},{"blob":"0235f2d36a96e83aac94ea4dfb3469d197cbd439","intervals":[[1,608]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/reviewOperation.ts"}],"job_id":"034a68b94523989cc7d1b132349b1b139fc8cee0b2a735782c5e2ba5988c6738:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"5d77f88df08ffd9f963cf8910d8c52c01685095a","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressDependencies.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"4ceab07e9840069b2d91198b56077557e1adf336","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressEvidence.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"0235f2d36a96e83aac94ea4dfb3469d197cbd439","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/review/internal/reviewOperation.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"5d77f88df08ffd9f963cf8910d8c52c01685095a","intervals":[[170,209],[211,220],[223,223]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressDependencies.ts"},{"blob":"4ceab07e9840069b2d91198b56077557e1adf336","intervals":[[34,34],[234,234]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressEvidence.ts"},{"blob":"0235f2d36a96e83aac94ea4dfb3469d197cbd439","intervals":[[153,195],[204,205],[331,331],[36